#: ../../08_release-notes.md:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`@decentralchain/ride-repl` 1.6.2 is published to npm (tag `ride-v1.6.2`). It fixes the build of the JavaScript Ride compiler it bundles. See {doc}`Ride REPL <04_building-apps/developer-tools/01_ride-repl>`."
